msgstr "请输入首次连接所需的 CalDAV 密码。"

#: hsp-calendar-connection.php:451
msgid "Enter the password for the new CalDAV server. A saved password is never forwarded automatically to a different server."
msgstr "请输入新 CalDAV 服务器的密码。已保存的密码绝不会自动转发到其他服务器。"

#: hsp-calendar-connection.php:1420
msgid "Existing managed appointments must be migrated before changing the booking destination."
msgstr "更改预约目标日历前，必须迁移现有受管预约。"

